# Conformance probe pack for a default outside its range (0.56) and for the
# rounding of the wrap formula (ruling 11). Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-range-056-4
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.x  x  int  range 0 10
default probe.x  99
field   probe.a  a  float  range 0 0.1 wrap
